    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040110,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "どれもすごくて…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、俺も見たのは結構前だけど\r\n演技が上手だと思った記憶があるな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040120,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……それを観ながら、この間プロデューサーさんに\r\n言われたことを思い出してました",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040130,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "『求められるわたしでいることも\r\n大事かもしれないけど』",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040140,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "『自分がどうなりたいかが\r\n一番重要だ』って……",
