    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040180,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……でも、気になって",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからわざわざここまで来て\r\n調べてたのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040190,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040200,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ドラマとか、雑誌で活躍するような人とか……\r\nアイドルの子たちも、学校で楽しそうにしてる人たちも",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしとは全然違う世界の人みたいに思って、\r\n……勝手に羨んでました",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わたしがアイドルをやって、わたしと同じような人に\r\n元気をあげられたら、なんて思ってたけど",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……本当は誰でも、どこか\r\n足りないなって思う部分を持ってるのかもって",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "そんなことに、わたし、今まで……\r\nずっと気が付けませんでした",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことに\r\n今回の仕事を通して、気が付いたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………はい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_down",
