    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それならやっぱりあの仕事、\r\n小糸にやってもらえて良かった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "…………\r\nプロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040260"
  },
  {
    "select": "次の目標が\r\n見つかりそうか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "大変だけど\r\nいい仕事だったな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "仕事を通して\r\n成長できたな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040270,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとつ、目の前の仕事を終えて、\r\n気が付いたことがあって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そしたら、この次の目標\r\n立てないとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040280,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……そうですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040290,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それもまた、\r\nもう少し考えてみます",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、じっくり考えて\r\n……決まったら教えてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸が、色々なことを考えて\r\n大事なことに気が付いたなら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040300,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……そうですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200504/2022005040300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022005040310,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "きっと、こうやって……\r\n２８３プロでアイドルをしていなかったら",
